en><string name="ScriptGuid">{8A3D6ABD-3139-4B1C-8F0F-98132383CA9D}</string><ProtectedString name="Source"><![CDATA[--Make sure SmokePart is in WheelFixed model (NOT Fixed).
--The arrow on SmokePart has to point towards the front of your car.
--SmokePart has to be in all four wheels.
--SmokePart has to lay flat with the bottom of your tire.
--(Not too low or tiremarks will clip through the ground)


--Remove Advanced_Smoke_v1.1 script from SmokePart and put it in Plugins folder


--Image preview of proper installation moved onto a decal "Install_Guide" (to avoid potential offsite links)

